# Volunteer CRM — canonical repository

This folder is the **only** maintained Volunteer CRM codebase.

- **Git remote:** https://github.com/henrytroyer/monday.git
- **Local path:** `/Users/lesvoscoordinator/Documents/Monday/monday`
- **Local dev:** `npm run dev:live` → http://localhost:4040
- **Production:** https://i58-finance.web.app/admin?tab=monday-project (deploys from this repo via i58finance)

## Git workflow

Always run `git pull`, `git commit`, and `git push` **in this repo** (`henrytroyer/monday`).

Do **not** use `henrytroyer/crm-prototype` — it is archived.

## Production env vars

Code changes land here; production `VITE_*` board ids are baked in **henrytroyer/i58finance** deploy workflows. When adding a new env var, update both this repo's `.env.example` and i58finance `.github/workflows/deploy-monday-crm.yml` + `deploy-prod.yml`.

